        "node_id": "n_1_c2782f",
        "thought_text": "I need to modify the logic to handle the case where there are more opening delimiters than closing delimiters, printing 'ok so far' instead of the first unmatched opening delimiter. This requires checking the stack after processing all characters and only printing the last unmatched opening delimiter if the stack is not empty.",
